{{!-- Rendered whenever an Attack roll snapshotted >=1 target (see
      module/dice/dice.mjs's CarlDice.rollAttack and module/chat/
      evade-link-card.mjs) - lets a defending token actively roll Evade
      (Interrupt Action, Carl RPG p.81) instead of accepting the static
      Difficulty auto-resolution above. The button's click handler and
      GM/owner visibility gating are wired up client-side by the shared
      registerChatListener (module/chat/chat-listener.mjs), via this
      button's data-action and evade-link-card.mjs's evadeActionEntries -
      not baked into this markup. --}}
<div class="carl-evade-link">
  <button type="button" class="carl-roll-evade" data-action="rollEvade">
    <i class="fas fa-person-running"></i> {{localize "CARLRPG.Evade.RollButton"}}
  </button>
</div>
